# Directory List Tables

Layout (`directoryColumnWidths.ts`):

```
[ Sticky Name — content width ] [ Flexible middle ] [ Sticky Actions — content width ]
```

| Column | Sizing |
|---|---|
| Name (sticky left) | Fixed ~320px — fits “Arya Ganapathy Kallambella”; does **not** grow |
| Role / Hometown / Class / UTR / WTN | Share remaining width (no fixed width) |
| Actions (sticky right) | Fixed 152px — Call / Text / Email only; does **not** grow |

Import sticky helpers from `@/components/data-table/stickyColumns`. Put `stickyColumnRowClass` on each `<tr>`.

- Never put `overflow-hidden` on sticky Name/Actions cells.
- DirectoryTable scrollport must not wrap the table in `min-w-full`.
- Hover / `aria-selected` / `data-selected` track via `group/row`.

Do not reimplement sticky CSS in feature modules.
